message: "If you use hae, please cite it as below, and cite the datasets you use (see NOTICE.md)."
title: "hae: an open thermal person detector for search-and-rescue drones"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The hae authors"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sashapiscivca-svg/hae"
url: "https://huggingface.co/sashapiscivca-svg/hae-s-ir"
keywords:
  - search and rescue
  - object detection
  - thermal imaging
  - drones
  - tiny object detection
  - edge AI
  - Raspberry Pi
abstract: >-
  hae-s-ir is a small, fully open person detector for thermal (LWIR) aerial imagery,
  trained from scratch on openly licensed civilian datasets and designed to run on a Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W.
